{
 "id": "seg1",
 "title": "一个捐赠函数",
 "pill": 1,
 "total": 72.26,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2023 年 3 月 13 日，借贷协议 Euler Finance，损失约 1.97 亿美元，按事发时估值。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 3 月 13 日，借贷协议 Euler Finance，损失约 1.97 亿美元，按事发时估值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 8.4,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 9.806
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "入口，是一个捐赠函数。",
   "spoken": "入口，是一个捐赠函数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 10.22,
   "dur": 2.48,
   "speechStart": 10.312,
   "speechEnd": 12.455
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "它让用户把自己的存款，捐给协议的储备。",
   "spoken": "它让用户把自己的存款，捐给协议的储备。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 12.92,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 12.92,
   "speechEnd": 16.516
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "捐出去，账户的抵押品就少了。",
   "spoken": "捐出去，账户的抵押品就少了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 16.98,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 16.98,
   "speechEnd": 20.071
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "但这个函数，不检查账户是否仍然健康。",
   "spoken": "但这个函数，不检查账户是否仍然健康。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 20.48,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 20.48,
   "speechEnd": 24.064
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 24.46,
   "dur": 1.04,
   "speechStart": 24.46,
   "speechEnd": 25.261
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "举个例子。一个账户有 100 美元抵押品，借了 90 美元。",
   "spoken": "举个例子。一个账户有 100 美元抵押品，借了 90 美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 25.72,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 25.72,
   "speechEnd": 31.67
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "它捐出 30 美元抵押品，没人检查，也没人偿还。协议的缺口是多少？",
   "spoken": "它捐出 30 美元抵押品，没人检查，也没人偿还。协议的缺口是多少？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 32.1,
   "dur": 8.24,
   "speechStart": 32.1,
   "speechEnd": 40.147
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "缺口是 20 美元。",
   "spoken": "缺口是 20 美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 40.84,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 40.84,
   "speechEnd": 43.302
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "账户只剩 70 美元抵押品，却欠着 90 美元。",
   "spoken": "账户只剩 70 美元抵押品，却欠着 90 美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 43.7,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 43.799,
   "speechEnd": 50.259
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "这 20 美元成了坏账，最后由存款人或保险基金承担。",
   "spoken": "这 20 美元成了坏账，最后由存款人或保险基金承担。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-10.wav",
   "start": 50.64,
   "dur": 7.44,
   "speechStart": 50.735,
   "speechEnd": 57.863
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "每个函数单独看，都没有错。",
   "spoken": "每个函数单独看，都没有错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-11.wav",
   "start": 58.3,
   "dur": 2.32,
   "speechStart": 58.3,
   "speechEnd": 60.368
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "攻击者也没有利用代码 bug。他只是按规则操作，换了一种设计者没想到的组合。",
   "spoken": "攻击者也没有利用代码 bug。他只是按规则操作，换了一种设计者没想到的组合。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-12.wav",
   "start": 60.84,
   "dur": 7.44,
   "speechStart": 60.93,
   "speechEnd": 68.095
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-13",
   "text": "规则本身，怎么会让协议亏钱？",
   "spoken": "规则本身，怎么会让协议亏钱？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg1-13.wav",
